  "content_html": "<p class=\"mobile-date-eyebrow\">25th September 2026</p>\n<div class=\"beat beat-sighting\">\n\n\n<div class=\"beat-content\">\n  <div class=\"beat-row1\">\n    <a class=\"beat-label sighting\" href=\"/elsewhere/sighting/\">Sighting</a>\n    <span class=\"beat-title\">7:07 PM – 7:27 PM</span>\n    <span class=\"beat-commit\">&mdash; Northern Gannet, Great Blue Heron, California Brown Pelican, in Monterey Bay National Marine Sanctuary, CA, US, CA</span>\n  </div>\n  <captioned-image-gallery class=\"sighting-detail-gallery\" max-row-items=\"2\">\n    <figure><a href=\"https://static.inaturalist.org/photos/740453177/original.jpg\"><img src=\"https://static.inaturalist.org/photos/740453177/large.jpg\" alt=\"Northern Gannet\" loading=\"lazy\" data-width=\"2048\" data-height=\"1366\"></a><figcaption><a href=\"https://www.inaturalist.org/observations/403293902\" title=\"View observation on iNaturalist\">Northern Gannet</a></figcaption></figure><figure><a href=\"https://static.inaturalist.org/photos/740453341/original.jpg\"><img src=\"https://static.inaturalist.org/photos/740453341/large.jpg\" alt=\"Great Blue Heron\" loading=\"lazy\" data-width=\"2048\" data-height=\"1365\"></a><figcaption><a href=\"https://www.inaturalist.org/observations/403294028\" title=\"View observation on iNaturalist\">Great Blue Heron</a></figcaption></figure><figure><a href=\"https://static.inaturalist.org/photos/740454506/original.jpg\"><img src=\"https://static.inaturalist.org/photos/740454506/large.jpg\" alt=\"California Brown Pelican\" loading=\"lazy\" data-width=\"2048\" data-height=\"1365\"></a><figcaption><a href=\"https://www.inaturalist.org/observations/403294272\" title=\"View observation on iNaturalist\">California Brown Pelican</a></figcaption></figure>\n  </captioned-image-gallery>\n<div class=\"beat-note blogmark-body\"><p>New 200-800mm Canon EF lens got me my best photo of <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/Aug/15/sighting-391300422/\">Morris</a> yet. They really like hanging out under that sign in the harbor!</p></div>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"entryFooter\">Posted <a href=\"/2026/Sep/25/\">25th September 2026</a> at 2:07 am</div>\n<p class=\"edit-page-link\" data-admin-url=\"/admin/blog/beat/4964/\"></p>\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n</div> <!-- #primary -->\n\n<div id=\"secondary\">\n\n\n\n</div> <!-- #secondary -->\n</div> <!-- #wrapper -->\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<div id=\"ft\">\n    <ul>\n      <li><a href=\"/about/#disclosures\">Disclosures</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/about/#about-site\">Colophon</a></li>\n      <li>&copy;</li>\n      <li><a href=\"/2002/\">2002</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/2003/\">2003</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/2004/\">2004</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/2005/\">2005</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/2006/\">2006</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/2007/\">2007</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/2008/\">2008</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/2009/\">2009</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/2010/\">2010</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/2011/\">2011</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/2012/\">2012</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/2013/\">2013</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/2014/\">2014</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/2015/\">2015</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/2016/\">2016</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/2017/\">2017</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/2018/\">2018</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/2019/\">2019</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/2020/\">2020</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/2021/\">2021</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/2022/\">2022</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/2023/\">2023</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/2024/\">2024</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/2025/\">2025</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/2026/\">2026</a></li>\n      <li>\n        <button id=\"theme-toggle\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Toggle theme\">\n          <!-- Auto/System icon (default) -->\n          \n          <!-- Light icon -->\n          \n          <!-- Dark icon -->\n          \n        </button>\n      </li>\n    </ul>",
